  {
   "start": 0.39,
   "end": 2.73,
   "text": "Running a school is about more than teaching.",
   "scene": 1
  },
  {
   "start": 2.77,
   "end": 5.8,
   "text": "There are learners to manage, attendance to track,",
   "scene": 1
  },
  {
   "start": 5.84,
   "end": 9.04,
   "text": "results to record, and parents to keep informed.",
   "scene": 1
  },
  {
   "start": 9.39,
   "end": 13.205,
   "text": "Meet Funda360, a smart school management platform",
   "scene": 2
  },
  {
   "start": 13.245,
   "end": 16.13,
   "text": "designed to bring everything together in one place.",
   "scene": 2
  },
  {
   "start": 16.9,
   "end": 19.57,
   "text": "From learner records and attendance to assessments,",
   "scene": 3
  },
  {
   "start": 19.61,
   "end": 23.48,
   "text": "academic reports, school finances, and communication,",
   "scene": 3
  },
  {
   "start": 23.52,
   "end": 27.88,
   "text": "Funda360 helps schools organise their daily work more easily.",
   "scene": 3
  },
  {
   "start": 27.92,
   "end": 30.305,
   "text": "Teachers can focus on teaching.",
   "scene": 3
  },
  {
   "start": 30.345,
   "end": 33.47,
   "text": "School leaders can make better-informed decisions.",
   "scene": 3
  },
  {
   "start": 33.51,
   "end": 36.79,
   "text": "And schools can keep important information connected.",
   "scene": 3
  },
  {
   "start": 37.31,
   "end": 39.985,
   "text": "Whether it's an individual school, a school group,",
   "scene": 4
  },
  {
